    "sections": {
        "description": "AI-powered WordPress magazine theme. Pair with the Iris AI plugin for one-click summaries, per-article chat, semantic search, author voice profiles, and a conversational homepage.Every template is AI-aware — posts, authors, categories, archives, even the 404 page — so readers can ask AI about anything they are looking at. Underneath the AI layer, Vamika is still a serious magazine theme: long-form typography, an opinionated editorial colour system, responsive layouts, translation-ready markup, and optional Elementor widgets via the companion Iris Theme Kit plugin. Works fully standalone; AI features activate when the Iris AI plugin is installed."
    },
